    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Scary Together is a 4-player co-op horror game. Explore terrifying levels filled with jump scares, solve puzzles, and experience the thrill of being scared together. Perfect for players who love screaming\u2014and laughing\u2014with friends.<br><br>\ud83c\udfae Genre: Horror Co-op Experience</strong><br>Scary Together is a terrifying multiplayer horror game designed for up to <strong>4 players</strong>. Work as a team, or panic together, as you face your worst fears in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc65 4-Player Co-op</strong><br>Survive together in a group of four. Cooperation is key\u2014but fear can break even the strongest teams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc80 Jumpscares Galore</strong><br>Expect the unexpected. Scary Together is packed with <strong>intense jumpscares</strong> that will catch you (and your friends) off guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd13 Level-Based Progression</strong><br>Each level presents unique challenges, puzzles, and horrors. <strong>Clear each stage</strong> to uncover deeper layers of the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude02 Fun Through Fear</strong><br>Screams turn into laughter as you watch your friends freak out. In Scary Together, <strong>being scared has never been this fun</strong>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Scary Together is a 4-player co-op horror game. Explore terrifying levels filled with jump scares, solve puzzles, and experience the thrill of being scared together. Perfect for players who love screaming\u2014and laughing\u2014with friends.<br><br>\ud83c\udfae Genre: Horror Co-op Experience</strong><br>Scary Together is a terrifying multiplayer horror game designed for up to <strong>4 players</strong>. Work as a team, or panic together, as you face your worst fears in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc65 4-Player Co-op</strong><br>Survive together in a group of four. Cooperation is key\u2014but fear can break even the strongest teams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc80 Jumpscares Galore</strong><br>Expect the unexpected. Scary Together is packed with <strong>intense jumpscares</strong> that will catch you (and your friends) off guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd13 Level-Based Progression</strong><br>Each level presents unique challenges, puzzles, and horrors. <strong>Clear each stage</strong> to uncover deeper layers of the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude02 Fun Through Fear</strong><br>Screams turn into laughter as you watch your friends freak out. In Scary Together, <strong>being scared has never been this fun</strong>.</p>",
